What benefit could this be?
[Cele]b[ration] of Life slideshows are about[ paying tribute] to an individual by celebrating their life. It[�]�s using the images and or video taken over a lifetime adding a soundtrack of music or[ spoken word] and displaying the slideshow at a family and friends gathering. The gathering could be a funeral wake, golden wedding celebration, a retirement,[ significant birthday], wedding and I am sure that you can think of a few more.
